cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "AMMBA: Automated Market Maker for Batch Auctions"
abstract: >-
  AMMBA is an AMM-based trading mechanism for local energy communities. It
  clears each delivery slot against a community pool at one uniform price,
  given by a sigmoid function of the ratio between local supply and demand and
  bounded by the retail price and the feed-in remuneration. The repository
  contains the clearing engine, an offline calibration tool for the pricing
  parameters, a settlement engine for the GSY Decentralised Energy Exchange,
  and an optional on-chain audit anchor. Developed in Task 5.4 of the Horizon
  Europe project INTELLIGENT (Grant Agreement No. 101160678).
authors:
  - name: "University of Cologne, INTELLIGENT project team"
version: 0.1.6 # x-release-please-version
